Third-party material used by the fizz conformance suite
=======================================================

This directory contains material from the OpenAPI Initiative (OAI). It is
used only as test data. fizz does not ship it in the library.

1. OAI/learn.openapis.org (examples)
   Files:    orig/learn/examples/v3.{0,1,2}/*.yaml
   Commit:   82b82f372aa185a07ea11bc158619895ab21f741
